* Transistor Circuit
V1 1 0 DC 5V
Vi 8 0

R1 4 8 33k
RS 8 9 2k
R2 9 7 22k
RE 7 5 4k
RC 3 2 4k
RL 3 10 5k

C1 8 9 1u
C2 3 10 2u
CE 5 0 10u

Q1 3 9 7 NPN

* Connections
* 1: V+
* 2: Top of RC
* 3: Collector of Q1
* 4: Top of R1
* 5: Emitter of Q1
* 7: Emitter, RE connection
* 8: Input Vi and RS
* 9: Base of Q1 and R2
* 10: Output Vo and RL

.end